{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act42side_level_act42side_05_end",
  "groupId": "act42side",
  "stageId": "act42side_05",
  "title": "共融",
  "storyCode": "MT-5",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act42side/level_act42side_05_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "c0bf27a4f95b98d913488be6480ce8bd741179ef22edc3e142bcf6b8cede572a",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "61_g2_baptismlobby"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "木攀獸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1790_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1777_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個響動……別緊張，孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "牧首。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "保育員先生，你也在。真是辛苦了，感謝你在這段時間的付出。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是盡我所能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1777_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個小傢伙還很脆弱。安多恩，帶牠回到牠的母親身邊吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1777_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我隨後便去找你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "牧首，您看起來有點虛弱……需要我護送您回去嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1777_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無妨，只是剛剛的心跳聲仍在我的體內迴響。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1777_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不只那位母親，帕特里奇昂，我聽到了不計其數的心跳在共鳴，幾乎快震塌這座聖堂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1777_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不論出身，不論種族，人們已經開始連結……但也有人已經拒絕了我們所展示的未來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1777_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "降生儀式可以到此為止了，不必讓同胞們在此逗留，準備下一步的工作吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我明白了。還請您去休息，這邊剩下的事情交給我就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "61_g2_baptismlobby"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再次感謝各位來到育嬰聖堂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不論諸位是否理解，又怎樣看待先前牧首在峰會上提出的主張，這隻木攀獸的降生與啟聖，無疑都給予了我們更明晰的啟示。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "關於如何跨越“國家”、“種族”的隔閡，關於如何從根本上消弭仇恨、締造和平……關於如何共同應對懸於頭頂的災異。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以降生儀式為起點，第二屆萬國峰會將正式進入下一階段——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉特蘭將向所有薩科塔之外的種族分享光環！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“願主將屬靈的恩典賜予每一人。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "61_g1_nurserytemplesquare"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "avg_213_mostma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "菲亞梅塔、莫斯提馬，這邊這邊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1811_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "蕾繆樂？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你什麼時候回來的？怎麼也不跟我們說一聲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這套新衣服不錯嘛，這副新手銬也……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "avg_1041_angel2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "本來想過一段時間給你們一個驚喜的，結果……嘿嘿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "avg_1041_angel2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（試圖抓頭）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_213_mostma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "蕾繆安，怎麼回事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1811_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……一兩句話說不清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "avg_213_mostma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要不然，我幫你爭取兩分鐘的逃跑時間？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "也可以——\n還是別給我老姐惹麻煩了，下次吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1811_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1780_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，我是不是打擾你們幾位好友團聚了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1811_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "前輩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1780_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "蕾繆安樞機，你自己一個人就能夠將嫌犯帶回第七廳嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1780_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還是說，需要支援……？畢竟試圖破壞育嬰聖堂、干涉萬國峰會，可是關係重大！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1811_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不放心的話，前輩你可以和我一起，或者讓銃騎監督。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1780_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別這麼說話嘛。畢竟根據阿摩斯輔佐官的證詞，你確實之前就在其他案發現場發現了蕾繆樂的蹤跡……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1811_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是想說，我試圖包庇自己的妹妹？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1780_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "並非如此，畢竟都是間接證據，不足以說明你採取了什麼行動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1780_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還記得我們之前在聖堂內的談話嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1780_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我很欣賞你的能力和辦事手段，“噤聲的蕾繆安”，不過我也清楚你那些美好的特質一般在什麼時候最能體現出來……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1780_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "更何況這次牽涉到的是你的妹妹，我們有所懷疑也是在所難免，請你理解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1811_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你們大可放心。放小樂背著一身罪名亂跑，並不能真正幫到她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1780_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯嗯，只要蕾繆樂能夠配合，我相信這裡面的誤會一定能解開的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_213_mostma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "稍微等等，“微光守夜人”，還有……萬國信使莫斯提馬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "avg_213_mostma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1780_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "兩位請暫時留在育嬰聖堂，教皇廳有些任務需要交給兩位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "61_g1_nurserytemplesquare"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1779_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小樂姐……被帶走了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1779_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗚，好不容易說服老師讓我出來，結果還是來不及……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1779_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這，怎麼辦，梵妮，你還能做些什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "61_g4_nurseryindoor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1777_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不必叩門，安多恩。我沒有任何事需要迴避你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1777_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "孩子的母親？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "已經入睡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我把這孩子帶了過來。牠的羽毛還沒長齊，但驚人地有活力。我猜，您或許會想再摸摸牠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1777_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝。這對我來說也是一種慰藉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1777_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還記得嗎？你我來到拉特蘭後，為了安置這孩子的母親，臨時建了這間屋子，後來這裡成為了整座聖堂的第一間育嬰室。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然。我和您一起鋪好了這簡陋卻溫暖的床鋪，掛好了安撫鈴，讓牠得以安睡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1777_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然這個房間早已不再使用，但我時常會重回這裡，哪怕只是簡單地禱告。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1777_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……這裡是你我的起點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "木攀獸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1790_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（愜意地舒展身體）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1777_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我能感受到，牠也喜歡這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1777_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說起來，這孩子的光環真閃亮啊。你抱牠進來的時候，我就感受到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是您一直以來堅信的奇蹟，牧首。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是，我仍不明白，您是如何在最初見到牠的母親時，就看到了奇蹟的預兆？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1777_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，安多恩，我那時沒有看到任何預兆，我只看到你的內心在掙扎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1777_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "牠那時已油盡燈枯，需要的並非救治，而是安葬。但你仍想救牠，你不希望這個念頭在常識的沖刷下消散。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1777_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我堅信的，是你精心保護的那一個念頭，可以締造生命的奇蹟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1777_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "生命是偉大的，“常識”這種尺規從來都無法用來測量它的歷程。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "任何人都會有救牠的念頭，牧首。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1777_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以任何人都可以締造奇蹟。或許就是因為人們不願相信信仰的力量，奇蹟才會被稱作奇蹟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1777_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安多恩，你難道不曾想過，是光環賦予了薩科塔信仰，還是信仰為薩科塔帶來了光環？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1777_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們的律法、共感和銃武以及我們依託這些建立起的樂園……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1777_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它們的開端，難道真如常識所示，只是一種毫無來由的恩賜？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……我不知道，牧首。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1777_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "過去有其開端，未來亦然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1777_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "育嬰聖堂……這座高聳入雲的巨型結構，並非於一日之內落成。它的開端也只是這樣一間平平無奇的育嬰室。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們的育嬰室……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1777_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你我最初可曾手握宏偉聖堂的藍圖？不，我們只是想要一個安全而舒適的房間，用來安置那位母親……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1777_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但它依然一發不可收拾地演化成了現在的樣子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1777_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼，一個所有人都得救的未來，當然可以起始於你我的信仰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "牧首……我追隨您，是因為我為了那樣一個未來苦尋已久，而您恰巧知曉道路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我不曾想過，也無法理解，為何您會認為那條道路的開端在於我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我終究只能做些微不足道的小事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1777_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "微不足道的小事，驚天動地的壯舉，不過一線之隔，一念之差。你苦尋多年才跋涉至此，不應該為了這種無謂的區別而止步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1777_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "接下來，除了照顧好這對母子，我需要你打起精神，去做更多的事情……比如，下一場降生儀式。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "61_g12_firearmsworkshop"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們來得比通知時間還早啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "該收拾的都已經收拾完了，你們直接貼上封條吧，貼完我就能回去睡覺了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銃騎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_358_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "帕特里奇昂？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘖，差點罵錯人了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是說最後的接收步驟是公證所負責嗎？怎麼來的是銃騎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銃騎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_358_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "前提是，一切正常，你沒有做什麼手腳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼意思？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銃騎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_358_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我剛剛檢查了工坊內的材料室以及所有的操作設備，明顯有近期使用過的跡象。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銃騎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_358_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想，阿摩斯樞機輔佐官上次來的時候應該聲明過——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銃騎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_358_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "簽署工坊關閉文件後，銃械工坊一應業務即告終止，私下進行任何守護銃或爆破物相關的製作活動將被視為違背條律。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我盤下這間小工坊也有幾十年了，說關就關，我捨不得……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最後這點時間，忍不住讓這些老朋友再動一下，聽聽聲響，流流眼淚，有什麼問題嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銃騎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_358_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "類似的說辭，您已經說過一遍了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銃騎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_358_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您的學徒，梵里妮小姐，您在育嬰聖堂門口帶走了她——她人呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可能又溜回去看降生儀式了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她不是小孩子了，我的視力又不好，怎麼管得了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銃騎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_358_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然如此，潘格尼尼先生，讓我們換個地方說吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果我不願意呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銃騎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_358_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如非必要，我不應該對您採取任何強制性的手段。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是帕特里奇昂那傢伙讓你來的，對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銃騎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_358_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……請吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "26_g6_laterano_chapelin"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的修女",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_370_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "銃騎閣下，您找席德佳？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銃騎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_358_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她不在修道院裡嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的修女",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_370_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在、她在的……但她剛好出了點意外，還在休息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銃騎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_358_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的修女",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_370_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，這要從哪裡開始說起呢……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的修女",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_370_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "昨天，突然有一輛告解車停在修道院門口，席德佳修女就躺在車廂裡……不、不省人事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的修女",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_370_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "告解車被設定好了終點，現場也沒有其他人在，我們不清楚她到底遭遇了什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的修女",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_370_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "銃騎閣下，或許可以等她醒來，我們再讓她去找您。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銃騎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_358_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "事態緊急，帶我去見她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的修女",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_370_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1784_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳咳……請不要為難格蘭修女。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的修女",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_370_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "席德佳，你醒了，感覺還好嗎？桌上的……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1784_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放心放心，只是有點暈而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1784_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我已經喝過桌上的熱粥了，咳是因為剛剛燙到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1784_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "銃騎閣下，您是為阿爾圖羅小姐的事情來的吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銃騎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_358_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1784_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您聽我說，阿爾圖羅小姐她確實擅自離開了蘭登修道院……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1784_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我已經在發現後的第一時間出去追了，請相信我，我已經找到她了！但……發生了一些意想不到的事情……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1784_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請再給蘭登修道院一點時間，不，請再給我一點時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銃騎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_358_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "席德佳修女，你介意跟我們走一趟嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1784_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……好，我跟您去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銃騎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_358_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了，這位修女，你也一起吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的修女",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_370_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1784_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "格蘭修女和這件事情沒有關係。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1784_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿爾圖羅小姐的監管事宜一直是我在負責，是我的失職……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銃騎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_358_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別緊張，席德佳修女。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銃騎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_358_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "蘭登修道院發生了這麼重大的事情，教皇廳需要知曉所有細節，盡可能收集相關線索。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銃騎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_358_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在，請跟我們走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
